  "name": "Peaches N Clean Carpet Cleaning and Water Restoration",
  "description": "Founded on June 1, 1991, Peaches N Clean has been a trusted leader in carpet cleaning, water restoration, and mold remediation services for over three decades. With a foundation built on faith, hard work, and perseverance, we have grown from a small team of two employees to becoming the preferred choice for major clients, including Marriott's Grand Hotel, Austal USA, state governors, celebrities, and even a president. We are proud to be the most award-winning provider of carpet cleaning, water restoration, and mold remediation services, holding some of the industry's most prestigious certifications in carpet, rug, and tile care. Our highly trained technicians utilize state-of-the-art techniques to ensure your home or business receives a deep, thorough clean that enhances longevity and promotes a healthier environment. As a recipient of the Angie's List Super Service Award, Peaches N Clean is recognized for delivering exceptional service and customer satisfaction. Whether you need expert carpet stain removal, emergency water damage restoration, or mold remediation, you can trust our proven expertise and commitment to excellence. We don't just clean; we restore and protect your living spaces with the highest standards in the industry.",
